  "title": "Air Fryer Vegan Buffalo Cauliflower",
  "description": "This air fryer vegan buffalo cauliflower features florets crisped in an air fryer, then tossed in Buffalo sauce for a tasty appetizer or main dish.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
